00:12:43,774 --> 00:12:45,080
kurts geredt...

204
00:12:47,807 --> 00:12:51,766
makht nit oys. ikh hob dos gezen, ⟨ah,⟩ s'iz geven, dos iz far mir...

205
00:12:52,270 --> 00:12:57,260
vu iz mayn ETO?... a!

206
00:13:00,311 --> 00:13:01,870
UNK

207
00:13:05,155 --> 00:13:06,590
ku-...

208
00:13:06,660 --> 00:13:08,030
⟨A TISSUE⟩.

209
00:13:09,087 --> 00:13:12,355
ikh dermon zikh, iz heyb ikh onet veynen...

210
00:13:13,052 --> 00:13:15,661
es shteyt in mayne oygn, farshteyst?

211
00:13:16,275 --> 00:13:20,270
dernokh dem, hot men geheysn undz oysshteln zikh.

212
00:13:21,608 --> 00:13:25,700
mir shteln zikh oyset. iz gekumen,...

213
00:13:26,569 --> 00:13:28,436
di vos zaynen ersht gekumen.

214
00:13:28,915 --> 00:13:30,883
vi mir hobn zikh nor oysgeshtelt...

215
00:13:36,215 --> 00:13:37,780
a dank...

216
00:13:45,705 --> 00:13:48,416
mir zaynen geven a man fuftsik, nit mer,

217
00:13:48,658 --> 00:13:53,250
 vos zaynen ersht ongekumen, fun di NATSMENes.

218
00:13:53,805 --> 00:13:56,617
es geyen arayn dray NEMTSes,

219
00:13:59,256 --> 00:14:02,380
un m'hot geheysn undz oysshteln zikh i- i-

220
00:14:02,380 --> 00:14:06,709
in eyn kolone. nit, eyne nokh di andere — in eyn rey.

221
00:14:07,204 --> 00:14:13,200
un zey hobn gegangen, yedern gekukt in di oygn. undz hot oysgeshtelt eyner a UKRAINETS,

222
00:14:13,397 --> 00:14:15,416
a kleyner ROST aza min o,

223
00:14:15,625 --> 00:14:19,990
mit a opgesherte kop, mit, ongeton mit GENERAL'SKe hoyzn, hot er ergets

224
00:14:19,990 --> 00:14:21,711
bay a general aropgerisn,

225
00:14:22,375 --> 00:14:29,730
mit,... er hot untergegangen. redn oyf NEMETSKe ken er nit.

226
00:14:29,918 --> 00:14:35,290
"GOSPODIN," sh- shrayt er, "OFITSER, JAWOHL. HEIL HITLER."

227
00:14:37,174 --> 00:14:38,518
shtil geshtanen.

228
00:14:39,874 --> 00:14:45,480
kitser, zey geyen farbay undz un kukn yedern in di oygn, un me shlept aroys mentshn.

229
00:14:46,017 --> 00:14:50,330
zey reydn nit, shlepn... eyner hot zikh opgeshtelt antkegn mir.

230
00:14:50,330 --> 00:14:54,042
ikh gedenk im; di tsure zayne iz geven ot ot aza, mit aza shram,

231
00:14:54,623 --> 00:14:57,418
mit aza hitl a fardreyte, ot a- a kokarde.

232
00:14:57,525 --> 00:14:59,409
er hot zikh in mir ayngekukt,

233
00:15:00,046 --> 00:15:01,800
un er iz durkhgegangen.

234
00:15:04,512 --> 00:15:07,140
bay mir hot zikh opgerisn dan di harts.

235
00:15:07,532 --> 00:15:10,327
es vilt zikh nit, me zol fun mir shnaydn shtiker.

236
00:15:11,970 --> 00:15:13,888
TY PONIMAESH'? kh'hob gevolt,

237
00:15:13,978 --> 00:15:18,640
getrakht vegn toyt, nor shray- shnaydn shtiker hot zikh mir nit gevolt fun mir.

238
00:15:19,716 --> 00:15:22,670
m'hot avekgetribn a man elf

239
00:15:23,614 --> 00:15:26,450
in komendature. nu, dortn

240
00:15:26,450 --> 00:15:31,778
heyst men zey, me mest zey oyset ale mo- m- mest zey alts oys, ahin, aher, me...

241
00:15:31,778 --> 00:15:33,947
un dernokh dem heyst men reydn tsvishn zikh,

242
00:15:33,947 --> 00:15:38,120
I VSЁ DRUGOE. zet men az s'iz nit keyn yidn, lozt men zey opet.

243
00:15:40,118 --> 00:15:42,609
un di kolone, mir zaynen geblibn shteyn.

244
00:15:43,122 --> 00:15:48,400
zogt er, ot der KONOPATer, "VSEM RAZOYTIS'!" un oyf mir makht er, "ZHID, TY OSTAVAYSYA.

245
00:15:48,927 --> 00:15:50,687
TY DUMAL," zogt er, "SKROESH'SYA.

246
00:15:50,687 --> 00:15:53,055
YA," zogt er, "NE NEMETS.

247
00:15:53,095 --> 00:15:55,940
NEMTSY," zogt er, "NE RAZBIRAYUTSYA V ZHIDAKH.

248
00:15:56,115 --> 00:15:58,850
MY," zogt er, "UKRAINTSY RAZBIRAEMSYA."

249
00:15:59,457 --> 00:16:02,740
zog ikh, "YA NE ZHID. TY SAM ZHID.

250
00:16:02,764 --> 00:16:06,240
YA NE ZHID. CHTO TY NA MNE KRICHISH', YA ZHID?"

251
00:16:06,426 --> 00:16:08,760
ikh makh di intonatsye fun,

252
00:16:08,760 --> 00:16:10,739
fun di KAVAZKer felker.

253
00:16:10,898 --> 00:16:15,630
farshteyst? oyf rusish kumt dos oys, "YA NE ZHID. TY SAM ZHID."

254
00:16:15,630 --> 00:16:18,950
nor ikh hob gezogt, "YA NE ZHID. TY SAM ZHID.

255
00:16:18,950 --> 00:16:20,679
CHTO TY NA MNE GOVORISH' ZHID?"

256
00:16:21,175 --> 00:16:26,040
nor er hot mir ongehoybn traybn, hot arayngetribn in kazarme, in blok.

257
00:16:26,338 --> 00:16:29,606
s'iz geven kazarmes vu s'iz geven poylishe armey a mol.

258
00:16:30,017 --> 00:16:33,318
hot er mir arayngetribn ahin. zaynen gezesn lebn a tish,

259
00:16:33,477 --> 00:16:39,970
a tsunoyfgeklapter tish, mit p- m- fun palkes di, di, di fis,

260
00:16:39,970 --> 00:16:43,359
fun, beryozeve, azelkhe vayse UNK ⟨faran aza⟩ boym,

261
00:16:43,382 --> 00:16:46,600
un me shpilt in kortn, fir POLIZEIen.

262
00:16:46,943 --> 00:16:50,244
zogt eyner, "PETRE, TY ESHCHЁ ODNOGO ZHIDA SPOYMAL?"

263
00:16:51,313 --> 00:16:54,479
zogt er, "SKRYLSYA. ON GOVORIT, CHTO ON ARMYANIN.

264
00:16:55,026 --> 00:16:58,159
YA KHOCHU," zogt er, "CHTOB ON SAM PRIZNALSYA."

265
00:16:59,059 --> 00:17:02,394
zog ikh, "CHTO TY MNE GOVORISH'? YA NE

266
00:17:02,468 --> 00:17:05,090
ZHID. YA ARMYANIN."

267
00:17:06,366 --> 00:17:08,810
tsu im. "YA ARMYANIN.

268
00:17:08,896 --> 00:17:10,662
CHTO TY MNE GOVORISH'?"

269
00:17:11,344 --> 00:17:14,325
makht er, "A TY PO-ARMYANSKI GOVORIT' MOZHESH'?"

270
00:17:14,550 --> 00:17:17,110
zog ikh, "DAY MNE VSEKH ARMYAN!

271
00:17:17,110 --> 00:17:19,162
YA BUDU PO-ARMYANSKI GOVORIT'.

272
00:17:19,162 --> 00:17:22,798
CHTO TY NE ZNAESH', CHTO YA MOGU GOVORIT' PO-ARMYANSKI?

273
00:17:22,798 --> 00:17:24,360
YA TEBE SKAZHU, CHTO YA MO-..."

274
00:17:24,360 --> 00:17:27,014
zog ikh tsu im, "breng mir aher ale ARMYANer,

275
00:17:27,409 --> 00:17:31,250
vel ikh dir bavayzn vi ikh reyd oyf, oyf ARMYANSKI.

276
00:17:31,341 --> 00:17:36,634
vos veystu nit az ikh veys, az ikh..." YA V DURAKA, ikh makh zikh far a nar.

277
00:17:36,994 --> 00:17:38,405
du farshteyst, tsi nit?

278
00:17:38,783 --> 00:17:42,840
ikh fal oyf im on, vorem ikh hob shoyn keyn ander breyre nit.

279
00:17:43,204 --> 00:17:47,850
makht eyner f- di vos, fun, zey hobn geshpilt, er hot gor oyf mir a, nit a kuk geton,

280
00:17:47,850 --> 00:17:53,036
zogt er, "TY NE... du veyst nit," zogt er, "az di kavkazisher felker

281
00:17:53,110 --> 00:17:57,694
zaynen, ge- zaynen OBREZANTSY, opgeshnitene,

282
00:17:58,105 --> 00:18:00,664
gemalte?" er hot a zog geton yenem.

283
00:18:01,530 --> 00:18:02,874
zogt er...

284
00:18:04,382 --> 00:18:07,670
er hot mir geheysn far deroyf oyston... kh'hob dir fargesn dertseyln...

285
00:18:07,670 --> 00:18:10,147
er hot mir geheysn oyston far deroyf di hoyzn

286
00:18:10,693 --> 00:18:12,172
un er hot dos derzen.

287
00:18:12,229 --> 00:18:14,552
er hot dos derzen, hot er zikh azoy derfreyt,

288
00:18:14,997 --> 00:18:20,610
azoy vi, tsum bayshpil, ikh ⟨ho-⟩ volt zikh derfreyen itster mayn zun, vos im iz shver tsu fardinen,

289
00:18:20,667 --> 00:18:22,618
 do a dolar,

290
00:18:22,759 --> 00:18:26,687
az er volt gevinen itster ⟨hund- a m-, a⟩ hundert milyon rubl,

291
00:18:26,687 --> 00:18:29,469
hundert milyon dolar. er hot zikh azoy derfreyt.

292
00:18:29,880 --> 00:18:31,790
vos ⟨iz? m'vet⟩ im gebn far deroyf

293
00:18:31,790 --> 00:18:34,953
a groyse matone, vos er hot mir gepakt.

294
00:18:35,044 --> 00:18:37,451
er vet mir opgebn ⟨SAUCKELen⟩ un ⟨SAUCKEL⟩,

295
00:18:37,558 --> 00:18:41,804
der yefreyter, vet zikh mit mir fanandershnaydn oyf, er vet mir fanandershnaydn oyf shtiklekh.

296
00:18:42,283 --> 00:18:45,620
ober s'iz shoyn geven far nakht. zogt er tsu mir,

297
00:18:46,047 --> 00:18:50,690
zogt er... ⟨nor d-⟩ ikh hob shoyn ⟨ba-⟩ dertseylt nokh deroyf.

298
00:18:50,690 --> 00:18:54,630
nemt er, git er mir mitn fus a klap, zogt, "tu zikh on.

299
00:18:54,630 --> 00:18:57,543
vest ergets bay mir nit antloyfn; bist in lager. morgn

300
00:18:57,543 --> 00:18:59,827
vel ikh dir gebn ekzamenes."

301
00:19:00,913 --> 00:19:04,893
zogt der tsveyter, "vos darfst zikh mit im dreyen? gib im op in komendature."

302
00:19:04,893 --> 00:19:07,590
zogt er, "neyn, ikh darf im aleyn," zogt er,

303
00:19:08,203 --> 00:19:09,918
"mit im fanandernemen zikh."

304
00:19:10,768 --> 00:19:15,300
un er traybt mir aveket aroys. un UNK...

305
00:19:15,520 --> 00:19:17,631
 vi ikh gey nor aroys,

306
00:19:18,160 --> 00:19:21,030
shteyt shoyn lebn ganek ot der ANTONYUK,

307
00:19:24,808 --> 00:19:28,820
fun ruminem plen, vos hot gezogt, YA ZHID.

308
00:19:29,888 --> 00:19:32,760
ON UZHE BYL U NEMTSEV; NECHEGO UDIRAT'.

309
00:19:32,760 --> 00:19:35,825
ikh bin a yid. "me darf nit antloyfn. er iz a ZHID.

310
00:19:35,825 --> 00:19:41,002
e- er me- er vil antloyfn, nor mir darfn nit. der, doytsh kormet undz gut."

311
00:19:41,295 --> 00:19:43,904
shteyt er oto do o. zogt er,

312
00:19:44,164 --> 00:19:47,347
"du bist lebn geblibn? zey hobn dir gelozn lebn?!"

313
00:19:49,648 --> 00:19:53,900
zog ikh, "du zest dokh," zog ikh tsu im, "her zikh ayn, ANTONYUK,

314
00:19:54,660 --> 00:19:56,820
gib mir nit aroys, ha?

315
00:19:57,968 --> 00:19:59,852
zol dos geyn vi es geyt.

316
00:20:00,860 --> 00:20:05,480
⟨S-⟩ zol mayn SUD'BA ⟨ar-⟩ mir firn;

317
00:20:05,680 --> 00:20:07,766
vifl ikh vel lebn vel ikh lebn.

318
00:20:07,992 --> 00:20:09,673
gib mir nit aroys.

319
00:20:10,270 --> 00:20:12,778
zey veln mir tseshnaydn oyf shtiker do o."

320
00:20:13,425 --> 00:20:16,550
zogt er, "ikh darf dir do nit hobn.

321
00:20:17,475 --> 00:20:21,451
nor eyn zakh: tu oys," zogt er, "dayne shtivl di KHROMOVe,

322
00:20:22,183 --> 00:20:24,860
SAPOGI, ⟨di⟩ shtivl KHROMOVe.

323
00:20:24,883 --> 00:20:30,058
tu oys dayne zakhn di eybershte"... bay mir ⟨iz⟩ OFITSERSKe,

324
00:20:30,115 --> 00:20:31,864
bay im iz SOLDATSKe geven...

325
00:20:32,106 --> 00:20:33,467
"un kum zikh baytn."

326
00:20:34,249 --> 00:20:36,437
zog ikh, "na." kh'hob ongehoybn oyston.

327
00:20:37,438 --> 00:20:40,149
zogt er, "oyf mir dayne shtivl iz kleyn."

328
00:20:41,455 --> 00:20:43,727
zog ikh, "to gib zey op kerik mir."

329
00:20:43,834 --> 00:20:46,967
zogt er, "i- ikh'l zikh mit imetsn umbaytn."

330
00:20:48,154 --> 00:20:52,970
nor er hot zey ongeshlept oyf zikh. zog ikh, "to gib mir di shikh."

331
00:20:53,385 --> 00:20:57,370
zogt er, di shikh vet er oykh farkoyfn. dortn iz geven m⟨eglekh dortn⟩ di,

332
00:20:57,370 --> 00:21:02,289
di s-, di, gefangene, bay dem gefelt dos, bay dem gefelt yents, flegt men zikh baytn.

333
00:21:02,768 --> 00:21:04,731
kitser, er hot mir a vorf geton di shikh.

334
00:21:04,731 --> 00:21:07,993
nor zogt er, "do git men a p- a payke broyt"...

335
00:21:09,619 --> 00:21:13,370
fun, tsvey hundert gram tsi hundert I fuftsik gram...

336
00:21:13,370 --> 00:21:15,181
"zolstu mir ale tog ir opgebn."

337
00:21:16,082 --> 00:21:18,253
ze ikh, vel ikh dokh shtarbn fun ir,

338
00:21:18,310 --> 00:21:20,020
on deroyf, on di esekhts,

339
00:21:20,020 --> 00:21:24,092
nor ikh veys az ikh darf dos take nit, vayle oyf morgn vet er dokh mir pakn, yener,

340
00:21:28,063 --> 00:21:29,390
yener STEPAN.

341
00:21:31,337 --> 00:21:35,560
ober ikh darf... bin ikh aroysgegangen. aroysgegangen.

342
00:21:36,214 --> 00:21:39,971
geyt tsu mir unter eyner un hot ongehoybn reydn mit mir oyf ARMYANSKI.

343
00:21:41,952 --> 00:21:48,038
itster hob ikh zikh fargesn dem nomen zaynem. farshteyst, tsi nit? vayle ikh bin oyfgeregt, hob ikh fargesn dem nomen.

344
00:21:48,938 --> 00:21:52,910
zog ikh, "her, her zikh aynet." ikh zog im oyf rusish.

345
00:21:53,072 --> 00:21:55,918
"ikh bin gehat gevorn nit in Armenye.

346
00:21:56,447 --> 00:22:00,238
ikh bin gehat gevorn in der RESPUBLIK AZERBAYDZHAN."

347
00:22:01,358 --> 00:22:04,442
s'iz dortn MUSUL'M⟨е⟩NSKe... Azerbaydzhan.

348
00:22:04,442 --> 00:22:09,181
"ikh bin a ARMYANIN. ikh bin geven in a kinder-gortn. bay mir iz nito keyn eltern.

349
00:22:09,289 --> 00:22:11,865
iz AZERBAYDZHANSKIY," zog ikh, "ken ikh,

350
00:22:11,888 --> 00:22:13,926
nor ARM⟨е⟩NSKIY ken ikh nit.

351
00:22:13,926 --> 00:22:17,060
TAK du reyd mir oyf rusish." tsu im.

352
00:22:17,322 --> 00:22:20,470
zogt er, "gut. KHOROSHO.",

353
00:22:20,629 --> 00:22:26,730
ot do hot men durkhgefirt shoyn di tsveyte partye, di UNK do hob ikh derzen di finfte partye. ikh hob shoyn derzen,

354
00:22:26,730 --> 00:22:30,710
m'hot getribn vayter a partye mit yidn.

355
00:22:30,710 --> 00:22:33,690
dos iz geven a zeyger

356
00:22:34,770 --> 00:22:38,881
zeks shoyn far nakht. s'iz shoyn ongehoybn vern fintster.

357
00:22:39,478 --> 00:22:42,130
UNK di letste partye hot men gefirt.

358
00:22:42,130 --> 00:22:45,904
iz kumt dos oys, oyb rekhenen tsu finf hundert, vi er hot mir gezogt,

359
00:22:45,904 --> 00:22:48,250
in a kupe PRIBLIZNe,

360
00:22:48,250 --> 00:22:51,960
iz kentik a tsvey a halbe toyznt hot men tseharget farn tog

361
00:22:52,843 --> 00:22:55,152
yidn in der⟨,⟩ in dem veldl,

362
00:22:55,152 --> 00:22:57,444
vos es iz geven oyf mayne oygn.

363
00:22:59,273 --> 00:23:03,910
ikh, a nakht hob ikh nit geshlofn. mir hobn gelegn RYADOM,

364
00:23:03,910 --> 00:23:07,370
eyne tsu di andere tsugekvetsht, avade a man toyznt,

365
00:23:08,554 --> 00:23:11,518
mit layz, mit BLOKHes, mit ale tsores.

366
00:23:12,722 --> 00:23:14,994
eynike shrayen, eynike dos o,

367
00:23:15,237 --> 00:23:18,910
 un ikh hob gezesn un getrakht vegn dem morgedik⟨UNK⟩ tog,

368
00:23:18,932 --> 00:23:20,175
dem fartog.

369
00:23:20,383 --> 00:23:24,590
fun yeder geshrey fleg ikh zikh g- gebn a khap fun shrek.

370
00:23:25,243 --> 00:23:29,357
s'iz dokh a vilde zakh, a vilde zakh, shnaydn shtiker fun mir

371
00:23:29,357 --> 00:23:31,109
un shitn mit zalts!

372
00:23:32,415 --> 00:23:35,700
es tut dokh keyner nit. FARAONen hobn nit geton dos!

373
00:23:35,700 --> 00:23:43,361
a mol di, di tumpe, di, di ⟨NE-⟩ di mentshn vi obezyanes kimat vi nokh geven.

374
00:23:45,915 --> 00:23:50,190
in der fri a koyles: mir zoln zikh gikh shteln oyfn gas.

375
00:23:50,623 --> 00:23:54,680
"gikh, gikh, gikh, gikh!" vert a koyles, oyf rusish.

376
00:23:55,298 --> 00:24:00,260
nu, me loyft. ikh oykhet. meyn ikh az do iz shoyn mayn, mayn sof.

377
00:24:01,558 --> 00:24:06,790
⟨es,⟩ me traybt undz arayn in hoyf fun komendature,

378
00:24:08,123 --> 00:24:12,240
me git undz tsu lebelekh broyt mit BALANDA,

379
00:24:13,202 --> 00:24:19,880
un do "gikh, gikh, gikh!" un me traybt undz oyfn vokzal, tsum ban,

380
00:24:20,998 --> 00:24:23,354
⟨durkhn⟩ shtot Gorlovke tsum ban.

381
00:24:23,698 --> 00:24:25,902
bin ikh do geblibn,

382
00:24:26,128 --> 00:24:27,970
do bin ikh gevor⟨n gl-⟩

383
00:24:27,970 --> 00:24:31,572
ikh hob glaykh farshtanen az do, fun dem bin ikh g- poter gevorn.

384
00:24:32,524 --> 00:24:38,019
m'hot undz arayngetribn in, in, di vagonen, tsu zekhtsik man in a vagon.

385
00:24:39,949 --> 00:24:41,445
ikh hob gelegn mit dem.

386
00:24:42,396 --> 00:24:46,600
un m'hot undz gebrakht tsu firn

387
00:24:46,767 --> 00:24:50,450
in shtot DNEPROPETROVSK iber dray teg.

388
00:24:50,648 --> 00:24:56,863
m'hot undz ⟨f-⟩ arayngetribn in turme... dertseyln vegn DNEPROPETROVSK iz oykh nito, s'iz a tsayt, iz bay mir farshribn do vegn,

389
00:24:56,863 --> 00:25:01,500
⟨vegn⟩... in tyu- dortn vayter hot men gebetn yidn aroysge- trebevet aroysgeyn,

390
00:25:01,903 --> 00:25:06,675
un zey hobn tsugenumen bay a draysik man fun der kolone. s'iz geven a dray hundert man:

391
00:25:06,675 --> 00:25:09,170
tsu zekhtsik man tsen vagonen.

392
00:25:09,345 --> 00:25:12,275
un me hot a, bay a draysik man tsugenumen,

393
00:25:12,282 --> 00:25:15,144
un vos hobn zey dortn geton? oyb me pakt a yidn,

394
00:25:15,184 --> 00:25:16,831
iz bay zey geven

395
00:25:17,023 --> 00:25:20,125
a UBORNAYA, dos heyst a SANUZEL, dos heyst

396
00:25:20,125 --> 00:25:22,350
avu me geyt, a oystret.

397
00:25:22,474 --> 00:25:25,460
farshteyst? iz geven oyfn gas.

398
00:25:25,613 --> 00:25:31,412
iz oto der oystret... s'iz a turme, geven an alte turme ESHCHЁ f- fun EKATERINen, fun der keyserinye...

399
00:25:31,468 --> 00:25:37,290
⟨o-⟩ iz hot men gemakht a naye, un oto do o, a tsveyte hot men aropgenumen oto di breter mit alts,

400
00:25:37,290 --> 00:25:41,435
iz geblibn oto do ineveynik oto dos o, di, di KHIMIKALII.

401
00:25:42,370 --> 00:25:44,743
iz flegt men untertraybn ahin a yidn.

402
00:25:45,475 --> 00:25:48,640
me flegt araynshisn im in di fis,

403
00:25:48,951 --> 00:25:52,438
er zol nit kenen ETO, un araynvarfn in di KHIMIKALII,

404
00:25:52,815 --> 00:25:55,174
un der yid flegt dortn mit tsores

405
00:25:55,174 --> 00:25:57,652
in deroyf, in, in deroyf shtarbn.

406
00:25:59,143 --> 00:26:00,858
ot dos iz geven

407
00:26:01,303 --> 00:26:03,491
di ELEGANTNOST' fun dem doytsh,

408
00:26:03,801 --> 00:26:05,212
fun dem NEMETS.

409
00:26:06,855 --> 00:26:10,730
UNK dos iz ummentshn. kurts geredt,

410
00:26:10,730 --> 00:26:13,008
fun dortn hot men undz avekgetribn

411
00:26:13,622 --> 00:26:15,420
in shtot CHENSTOKHOV.

412
00:26:16,407 --> 00:26:18,999
SO du host gegangen yetst tsu an andere lager?

413
00:26:18,465 --> 00:26:22,002
in an, in, shoyn in Poyln hot men undz otpravet. in Poyln.

414
00:26:20,813 --> 00:26:23,870
SO hot d- di ershte lager hot geven vu?

415
00:26:23,578 --> 00:26:25,040
in Gorlovke.

416
00:26:25,266 --> 00:26:27,780
un fun, un du host gebrakht dort...?

417
00:26:25,873 --> 00:26:28,970
 eyn tog, eyn nakht bin ikh dortn geven,

418
00:26:28,000 --> 00:26:30,500
eyn nakht. un nokh dem?

419
00:26:28,970 --> 00:26:33,646
⟨un eyn tog⟩. nokh dem in, DNEPROPETROVSK TYUR'MA,

420
00:26:33,889 --> 00:26:37,818
in tyurem, DNEPROPETROVSKe, shtot DNEPROPETROVSK,

421
00:26:37,818 --> 00:26:42,017
veyst, in a, v⟨UNK⟩, veyst vos s'heyst tyurme? nu, oykhet, nu, dos iz a lager UNK.

422
00:26:41,685 --> 00:26:42,539
yo?

423
00:26:42,208 --> 00:26:46,370
 VOT. nor frier iz geven a tyurme. zey hobn OSVOBO- aroysgelozn di,

424
00:26:46,370 --> 00:26:49,795
 di, di vos flegn hargenen mentshn

425
00:26:49,802 --> 00:26:55,162
fun tyurme, di ganovim aroysgelozn un UNK, di NEMTSes. iz...

426
00:26:54,105 --> 00:26:57,130
un di yor vos du hot geven in dem lager?

427
00:26:56,502 --> 00:26:57,373
ha?

428
00:26:57,130 --> 00:26:58,992
di yor. velkhe yor?

429
00:26:57,818 --> 00:27:02,970
do iz geven, in dem lager, kh'bin geven in d⟨UNK⟩ in dos o a, a teg tsen in gantsn,

430
00:27:02,970 --> 00:27:04,376
in DNEPROPETROVSK.

431
00:27:05,125 --> 00:27:08,850
un zey hobn undz fun dortn... dos iz alts Rusland geven, dos iz Ukrayne...

432
00:27:08,850 --> 00:27:11,096
un fun dortn hot men undz otpravet in Poyln.

433
00:27:11,031 --> 00:27:12,100
OKAY.

